From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: USA-RedDragon <USA-RedDragon@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:54:45 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(tui): security.image_render_paths confines image.render
 reads

image.render reads any local image on the gateway host. The new
security.image_render_paths key (default "any", unchanged) can confine it
to images Hermes stored itself ("media") or to those plus the host working
directories of the requesting connection's sessions ("workspace"). Paths
are resolved before the check, the rest of every Hermes home stays closed,
and a refused path gets error 4073. runtime.describe lists
image-render-confined-v1 while a confined mode is on.
